# DigitalGuardian area 53 with digitalguardian_knees.py: at each knee count (4, then 3, 2, 1, 0 as
# the spec clears the ids at fn_14_6E04 hits 500/900/1300/1700) the head picks a projectile attack
# (SelectProjectileAttack, fn_14_10120) and telegraphs it (bit 0x20 of head+0x10F4 while the body
# runs fn_14_6E04). At the end the body is deleted: fn_14_10120 with no body.
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11
@f140 send e00350060 Activate; send e0035000f Activate
@f300 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack
@f310 fsm e0035000f ProjectileTelegraph
@f700 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack
@f710 fsm e0035000f ProjectileTelegraph
@f1100 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack
@f1110 fsm e0035000f ProjectileTelegraph
@f1500 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack
@f1510 fsm e0035000f ProjectileTelegraph
@f1900 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack
@f1910 fsm e0035000f ProjectileTelegraph
@f2000 codecall e0035000f ResetProjectileAttackTimes
@f2200 send e00350060 Delete
@f2260 codecall e0035000f SelectProjectileAttack
@f2300 objs Guardian
@f2320 covdump
